  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7d4a5574f9afe80e9b1f6526b3099ecdbc2cb95c?download\" data-file-name=\"투석기-중.hwp\" data-file-size=\"4781056\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D39%26fileid%3D6%26regdt%3D20220422151010&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F7d4a5574f9afe80e9b1f6526b3099ecdbc2cb95c')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">투석기-중</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">4.56MB</div></div></a></div><p>4/22, 1학년 진도가 한시간이 갑자기 생겨서 마침 여러가지 힘 단원을 진행 중이라 투석기 만들기를 해보았습니다.</p><p>1차시로 진행했는데, 빠른 친구는 30분 정도로 완성했고, 늦은 친구는 완성 못해서 도움을 받았는데도 끝내 못한 친구도 있었습니다. (60분정도 필요했을것같습니다)</p><p>다같이 완성하고 컵성? 컵 쌓은것 쓰러뜨리기 하려고 했는데 그건 못했구요, 다 만든 친구들이 먼저 해보는 정도로 정리됐습니다.</p><p>완성된 것 복도에 책상 하나 놓고 올려놓고 전시(사용해보라고)해놓긴 했는데 딱히 해보진 않더라구요 ㅎ</p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1a7202460e945b0a413477cc6761c6f19b1e3ee0\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\" style=\"width:64.00%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1a7202460e945b0a413477cc6761c6f19b1e3ee0\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1ce2680c1fc6ade1a2b9f970ce6121ab02ca1421\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1440\" style=\"width:36.00%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1ce2680c1fc6ade1a2b9f970ce6121ab02ca1421\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div></div><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f6917ac208d2539a47756742c0a33f3c49df0ce5\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1440\" style=\"width:36.00%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f6917ac208d2539a47756742c0a33f3c49df0ce5\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/55f53c95d5d2308034fa87940e03f7cae1082242\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\" style=\"width:64.00%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/55f53c95d5d2308034fa87940e03f7cae1082242\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ab3db4125497da8d7ba1ddf35c1b935e70021e8e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ab3db4125497da8d7ba1ddf35c1b935e70021e8e\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"810\"></div><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvfouyioseyv6immluyc0n3s9@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rvfouyioseyv6immluyc0n3s9/thumbs/2.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33207516539&amp;signature=tmLp5qVZ3vRmIl72F0FdlWbU%2Fa4%3D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvfouyioseyv6immluyc0n3s9?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2Zm91eWlvc2V5djZpbW1sdXljMG4zczkiLCJ0aWQiOiI2YmI0ZDkwOS02YWVkLTQ3MGYtOTgyZC0wZTk1ZTY2OGFjN2UiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODI5NzB9.VV1iPPXvj3BIUexfpr7nBvwyg9OxH64x6LgXijfeMKb1S9bKxRjo-5Jtb4hwfdsQQ_aphtzVvmCU54J47Nv9Jg&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>투석기 완성 후 활동을 몇가지 만들고, 다같이 할 수 있도록 먼저 완성한 친구는 아직 못 한 친구들 도와달라고 하면 좋을 것 같습니다.</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
